  "description": "Overview HAQATHON 2.0 – Hack the Next Quantum Decade HAQATHON 2.0 is a 24-hour quantum computing hackathon organized as part of PLUS Qiskit Fall Fest 2026 at RGUKT Srikakulam, celebrating a decade of quantum computing on the cloud. The hackathon brings together students, developers, researchers, and quantum enthusiasts to explore the possibilities of quantum computing through hands-on problem-solving, collaborative development, and innovation. Participants will work in teams to develop solutions using quantum computing, Qiskit, hybrid quantum-classical approaches, quantum algorithms, optimization, quantum machine learning, and other emerging quantum technologies. The challenge is not just about writing code—it is about identifying meaningful problems and exploring how quantum technologies can contribute to solving them.",
